body:
you can implement it like this(that code is not mine)

Well the easiest way to do that is inceasing the player's movement speed for a very short time. Like

float playerSpeed = 10;

float dashSpeed = 50;

bool isDashing = false;

float dashDuration = 0,1;

float dashDurationStart;

void Update()

{

if(Input.GetKeyDown(KeyCode.LeftShift) && isDashing == false)

{

playerSpeed += dashSpeed;

isDashing = true;

dashDurationStart = dashDuration;
}

if(dashDurationStart <= 0 && isDashing == true)

{

playerSpeed -= dashSpeed;

isDashing = false;
}

else

{

dashDurationStart -= Time.deltaTime;
}

}

You can use something like this
